# This repository is a static, documentation-only "awesome list".
# It has no runtime and requires no secrets or environment variables to build,
# lint, or link-check the content.
#
# This file exists to document that explicitly for contributors and tooling.
# If future tooling needs configuration, declare each variable here with a
# placeholder value (never a real secret), e.g.:
#
# EXAMPLE_TOKEN=your-token-here
